        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Drive-in Springlatch Assembly for Weslock Door Levers</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor Privacy and Passage function Weslock <b>Door Levers</b>. \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking such as a bathroom door.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/door-lever-drive-in-deadlatch-for-weslock\">Weslock Drive-in Deadlatch</a> for Keyed Entry Door Lever (door levers with lock cylinder inside).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWeslock 600 series. For use with <a href=\"/collections/weslock-molten-bronze-collection\">Weslock Molton Bronze Collection</a>, <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\">Weslock Elegance Collection</a> and <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\">Weslock Traditionale Collection</a>, <b>Door Levers</b> (not door knobs) and <b>Entry Handles with Door Levers.</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note: </b>If you have a Weslock Door Knob use, <a href=\"/products/door-knob-drive-in-springlatch-for-weslock\">Weslock Door Knob Drive-in Latch</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAdjustable  for both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets. <br>\r\nDrive-in type latch (*Does NOT use a faceplate).\r\n</p>",
